sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as 用户
    participant HP as HomePage
    participant FAB as MountainFab
    participant AP as AddTxPage
    participant AI as AmountInput
    participant CR as CategoryRepository
    participant TR as TxnRepository
    participant TD as TxnDao
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant AS as AppState
    participant HC as HomeController
    participant SR as StatsRepository

    U->>FAB: 点击（收起态）
    FAB->>FAB: 展开胶囊 300ms
    U->>FAB: 再次点击
    FAB->>AP: Navigator.pushNamed /add
    AP->>CR: listByType(expense)
    CR-->>AP: List Category
    AP->>AP: 默认选中第0个分类，类型=支出

    U->>AP: 敲数字键 1 2 .
    AP->>AI: input(1) / input(2) / input(dot)
    AI->>AI: 字符串状态机校验 整数7位 小数2位
    AI-->>AP: display = 12.
    AP-->>U: 金额卡刷新 40px 大字号

    U->>AP: 选择分类 / 输入备注 / 选择日期
    U->>AP: 点击保存
    AP->>AI: minor 分

    alt 金额小于等于0
        AP-->>U: Toast 请输入金额 不落库
    else 类型等于转账
        AP-->>U: Toast 转账功能暂未开放 回落支出 不落库
    else 正常
        AP->>TR: add(bookId, categoryId, type, minor, note, date, time)
        TR->>TR: 校验 minor 大于0 且 category 存在
        TR->>TD: insert(txn.toMap())
        TD->>DB: INSERT INTO txn
        DB-->>TD: newId
        TD-->>TR: newId
        TR->>AS: bumpData 递增 dataVersion
        TR-->>AP: Result success newId
        AP->>AP: Navigator.pop
        AP-->>U: Toast 已保存 餐饮 -12.00
    end

    AS-->>HC: notifyListeners
    HC->>SR: homeStats(bookId, today)
    SR->>TD: sumByRange / countByRange / listByDate
    TD->>DB: SELECT SUM amount_minor
    DB-->>TD: 聚合结果 分
    TD-->>SR: int
    SR-->>HC: HomeStats
    HC->>HC: notifyListeners
    HC-->>HP: 重建 标题/概览卡/今日支出/预算卡/当日明细
